body:
If we OR them, the environment variables won't work anymore, as `RENDER_GRAPH_REORDER` is always `1`, so you won't be able to disable it when DEBUG_ENABLED is defined. What I can do is leave them, and put them in the `#else` section:

```c++
#else

static void configure_render_graph_flags() {}

static bool render_graph_reordering_enabled() {
	return RENDER_GRAPH_REORDER == 1;
}

static bool render_graph_full_barriers_enabled() {
	return RENDER_GRAPH_FULL_BARRIERS == 1;
}

#endif
```

